"""Synthetic opencode JSONL trace — used by test_token_profile.

Schema mirrors a real opencode/harness trace: each line is JSON, tool
events carry ``type=tool``, ``tool=<name>``, ``callID``, and ``state`` with
``status``, ``input``, and ``output``. Non-tool lines (``type`` other than
"tool" — session, loop, stream events) must be ignored.
"""
